    "description": "The Pet Adoption Foster Listing API provides access to a comprehensive list of pets available for fostering within the pet adoption program. This endpoint allows users to retrieve information on various pets, including their details, characteristics, and availability status. Typical consumers of this API include animal shelters, pet adoption agencies, and foster care coordinators looking to connect with potential foster caregivers. By utilizing this API, organizations can streamline their fostering processes and promote the pets in need of temporary homes.",
